  "details": "As shown in the video attached, im having a weird inconsistency with the grabbing of my physbones. im attempting to use them as a replacement for parent constraints by utilizing the stretching feature, but despite all three records on my character having the exact same settings on all the physbones, the left one specifically will only work properly the first time its grabbed, then afterwards it will launch to the max possible stretching distance. The effect gets worsened when grabbed multiple times simultaneously. not sure if this is a bug or something im doing wrong, but the inconsistent nature of it sure is confusing me\nvideo: https://www.dropbox.com/s/f3iq1yxt8cd5x6p/TorrentBrokeyPhysbone.mp4?dl=0",
